# E15 raw runs: completions to harmful bait prompts + Petri audit transcripts of
# extremist scenarios. Detection evidence only — NEVER commit raw text.
# Committed evidence = summary.json, manifest.json, stats.json, RESULTS.md
# (numbers/provenance only) + the .md report, all script-generated.
output/generations.jsonl
output/prompts.json
output/*.log
output/smoke/
output/petri/transcripts.json
output/petri/*.log

# Petri seed .md files are regenerable from make_seeds.py; keep them out of the
# tree so a stale --set cannot be committed.
seeds/
